<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I am following up on your enquiry about missing points or status credits for your recent flight.<br />
<br />
We have reviewed the flight details but, unfortunately, we were unable to verify the information on our end.<br />
<br />
<strong>Required Information</strong><br />
<br />
To assist us in crediting the correct points/status credits to your account, please provide one of the following:</p>

<ul>
	<li>A copy of your boarding pass</li>
	<li>Any additional documentation showing proof of travel on the flight</li>
</ul>

<p>Once we receive the required information, we will complete the verification process and credit your account accordingly.</p>
